{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the effect of replacing the image encoder with imagenet_vit_l in a multiprofile multimodal setup using pca_n2000 RNA encoding, avgpool aggregation, and concat fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.6287 (vs 0.6186 in config_005) suggests potential benefits from the new image encoder, though the exact contribution of the encoder versus other factors remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative encoders or aggregation methods."
}

